  "html": "<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":2416,\"mediaLink\":\"https://divergentjournaler.com/?attachment_id=2416\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"https://divergentjournaler.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_9900-768x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2416 size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"placeholder\":\"Content…\"} -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Note to self : This pen is a lot of fun, draw a shape... use a damp brush or watercolor brush and pull out shadows and color. Preused pages are fair game, always.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Supplies Used : Speedball Elegant Writer, B6 Stalogy </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
